@host = http://localhost:5080

### Elenco del menu
GET {{host}}/menu

### Ordina un cappuccino
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "drinkId": "cappuccino",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Bevanda sconosciuta (400)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "drinkId": "tè"
}
